<title>SINGAPORE: Hong Fok 1996 net profit tumbles 78 pct.</title>
<headline>Hong Fok 1996 net profit tumbles 78 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    7.90   vs     35.87</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)			2.00   vs	3.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		   5.80   vs     26.31</p>
<p>    Group shr fully diluted (cents) 5.47   vs     24.14</p>
<p>    Turnover			     63.99   vs    204.68</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest     0.24   vs	1.43</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		 24.33   vs     31.45</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	    1.18   vs	2.09</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	   0.88   vs	nil</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			9.90   vs     50.22</p>
<p>    Tax				     2.87   vs     15.46</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    (loss) 4.56   vs	4.06 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - Hong Fok Ltd is a diversified property-based firm</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
